WEBVTT

00:00:00.166 --> 00:00:03.516
Certificates are real learning, and they

00:00:03.528 --> 00:00:06.353
matter. But one working demo answers:

00:00:06.416 --> 00:00:08.366
can you build it?

00:00:11.004 --> 00:00:11.804
Learn it.

00:00:11.504 --> 00:00:12.579
Then show it.

00:00:12.817 --> 00:00:14.479
Turn learning into proof with Placiq.
